<Layout title="About & support"><div class="wrap">
<PageHeader title="Made by a student. Free for every learner." description="A passion project by Sayeem Sadik, also known as Leo Aristocrat." kicker="ABOUT D.EL.ED BUDDY" back="/" backLabel="Home"/>
<div class="two-col"><article class="content-panel prose"><h2>Education should be accessible to everyone.</h2><p>I believe learning should never depend on what someone can afford. D.El.Ed Buddy is completely free, and it will always remain free.</p><p>I’m building this project with care, one resource at a time, to help fellow D.El.Ed students find clear notes, useful visuals and practical guidance in one place.</p><p>From preparing and organising resources to building and maintaining the website, this takes many hours of hands-on work. I also pay for hosting and the tools behind it out of my own pocket.</p><a class="text-link" href="/materials/">Explore study materials →</a></article>
<aside class="feature-panel" id="contact"><span class="eyebrow">HELLO, I’M</span><h2>Sayeem Sadik</h2><p>You may know me as <strong>Leo Aristocrat</strong>.</p><p>A fellow D.El.Ed student who cares about making learning easier to access.</p><div class="personal-links"><a href="https://leoaristocrat.eu.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit my portfolio ↗</a><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:leoaristocratjr@gmail.com">leoaristocratjr@gmail.com</a></div></aside></div>
<section id="support" class="section support-section"><div><span class="eyebrow">OPTIONAL SUPPORT</span><h2>Help keep this little project growing.</h2><p>If these resources have helped you and you’d like to contribute, you can help cover hosting and tool costs, and support the time that goes into this project.</p><p>Every contribution is appreciated. Donating is entirely optional—all resources stay free for everyone.</p><a class="coffee-button" href="https://buymeacoffee.com/LeoAristocrat" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/support/buy-me-a-coffee.svg" alt="" width="25" height="36"/>Buy me a coffee</a></div><div class="content-panel upi-card"><h3>Support via UPI</h3><img class="upi-qr" src="/support/upi-qr.jpg" alt="UPI donation QR code supplied by Leo Aristocrat" width="1440" height="1432" loading="lazy"/><p class="small muted">Scan with your UPI app, or save the QR to pay from your phone.</p><a class="text-link" href="/support/upi-qr.jpg" download="Leo-Aristocrat-UPI.jpg">Save QR code ↓</a></div></section>
